From: Blessings <noreply@example.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 08:10:16 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Add staff birthdays: calendar, daily notices and wish board

Staff can save a birthday (day and month only, no year), choose who sees it,
and browse today's, upcoming and monthly birthdays. A daily job, run in the
organisation timezone, sends the birthday person a greeting and tells other
active staff, once per event. Colleagues can leave wishes on a message board;
the sender comes from the session, messages are permanent, and moderators can
hide reported wishes with an audited reason. Calendar and board reads are logged.

Additive: migration 0017, new screens under admin/birthdays, one new button in
Staff tools. A mutable "staff" notification category is added by widening the
existing category checks and two settings functions; nothing is removed.

